Some of the scribes and Pharisees said to one another, "This man is speaking blasphemies!
Jesus knew their thoughts, so he said to them, "Why do you think evil thoughts in your hearts?
Is it easier to say: "Your sins are forgiven"? Or to say: "Be empowered and walk"?
I want you to know that the Son of Man has authority on earth to forgive sins." Then He said to the paralytic, "Get up, pick up your bed and go to your house."
The man got up and went to his house.
