But I tell you that the people of Sodom will be in a better state on the Day of Resurrection than you will be." Comfort for all who are weary.
At that time, Jesus said, "You, your glory is great, O Father! You have hidden these things from the wise and the learned, and revealed them to little children."
Yes, Dad. This is what you wanted.
