Then the devil comes and brings out of him seven spirits more wicked than he is. They enter and dwell there. Thus the final condition of that man becomes more miserable than the first. Thus it is also for the wicked nation in this age.
And Jesus' mother and his brothers stood outside while he was still speaking to the crowd. And they wanted to call him.
