And when Jesus arrived at the shore, he saw a large crowd of people, and he felt a tenderness towards them. And he healed the sick among those who were lying at his feet.
When evening was coming near, the disciples came to Him, saying, "Behold, there is a place nearby where they can rest for the night."
Jesus answered, "They do not need to leave; you give them something to eat."
We said all we had was five loaves of bread and two fish.
He told them: "They are here."
