Everyone ate and were satisfied. The disciples then gathered what was left over, filling twelve baskets.
And the multitude of those who ate of the bread, were about five thousand men. Besides the women and children, and they took of the broken pieces that which was left over, until they filled twelve baskets with the broken pieces that were left over.
